ng?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K4DLlur4JacQ7kNvwF53Nqv&_nc_oc=Adp_5KnjYUaSRuDclRbBjU7g7d-x1AGMtX94jqaElQFI9StF6Rj2X1XQ2hcQLKP2hm8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af53P8cdE0kyJxy-SDAZDdYeLzu-dhO2tgngge_a4GiRoQ&oe=6A14636E"}, {"file_name": "5 (1).png", "id": "4279628335621327", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311585_4279628338954660_429886969531335801_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HJzFS8iZwHUQ7kNvwEAezMZ&_nc_oc=Ado1GmDXkWRJm6f5btAu1ddxEaKqXoLq_aJS0xndcsJA2f1CYxqrKbnxm2NeUTjN6Tw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af68JKMhQBLY2T5LMLyiiEUKahGqxchJjSWhd8kO3kT7Aw&oe=6A1471E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt_Landscape_1.png", "id": "2048142649116417", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308307_2048142652449750_6520910283344331188_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mPYRxTnW30gQ7kNvwGMD1hr&_nc_oc=AdrUDlBRs_BoditOi7PggJPXI6BKHInms7Dygm1I0-Iu5TUBQDOdWsWTXnZBMIrfEEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4x8DASMMoWjII9MbiAADO7DVorLaUVw5xO_31hYZtLgw&oe=6A1467CB"}, "display_name": "The Game With The Zombies", "keywords": ["zombieshooter", "vrshooter", "shooter", "arcade", "zombie"], "long_description": "# **The zombies are here.**\n\nThe Game With The Zombies is a fast paced endless VR arcade shooter where your mission is simple: survive as long as possible.\n\nFight nonstop zombie waves, climb the leaderboard, and listen to a sarcastic farmer who never stops judging your aim.\n\n**Features**\n\n - Endless zombie survival action\n\n - Funny farmer voice commentary\n\n - Global leaderboard competition\n\n - Comfortable stationary VR gameplay\n\n - Quick pick up and play action\n\n - High replayability\n\n\n**Final Question**\n\nHow long can you survive?", "short_description": "Endless zombie shooter. Survive, shoot, and top the leaderboard."}]}